---
description: Apex funnel, programs, and intake — do not grow the maze
globs: app/**/*.{ts,tsx},lib/**/*.{ts,tsx},components/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

This site sells the consult. Care happens in the portal.

Canonical path

1. Land on the site.
2. Assessment or program page.
3. `https://app.apexmetabolichealth.com.au/signup` (or login).
4. Intake, bloods, consult, protocol — all inside the portal.

Do not add a new `/intake/*`, `/book/*`, `/forms/*`, `/get-started`, or `/quiz` route. The maze already exists. Prefer linking to the portal or to `/start`.

If you touch an old public form, do not "improve" it into a parallel product. Either point it at the portal or leave it.

Programs

- Names and slugs: `lib/canonical-programs.ts` (what Nav uses).
- Page copy: `lib/program-configs.ts`.
- `lib/programs.ts` is leftover. Do not add to it. Do not invent a fourth catalogue.
- `app/api/chat/route.ts` must not advertise a program list or a booking URL that the rest of the site no longer uses.

Integrations (extend, do not replace)

- Stripe checkout: `app/api/create-checkout/route.ts` + `lib/intake-routing.ts`.
- Mail: Google Workspace SMTP via `lib/mailer.ts`. Resend is leftover.
- Pathology partner: Bloody Good Tests (`lib` + `app/api/bgt`).
- Practice: Cliniko.
- Chat: Haiku in `app/api/chat/route.ts`. Keep replies short. No prices. No drug names.

When two CTAs disagree (portal vs `/intake/hormone-consult` vs `/start`), prefer the portal signup unless the user is already mid-form.
